  "name": "Queens that attack exactly k others (A051759, A051758)",
  "description": "Exhaustive counts of maximal placements of queens on an n x n board in which every queen attacks exactly k others (blocked attacks), up to symmetry: A051759(10) = 39302 (k = 3); A051758 for n = 10..14 = 3, 37, 5, 83, 9 and ring-restricted counts to n = 19 (k = 2); with structure, a proof, conjectured closed forms, code and per-part data. Computed by an AI model; not peer-reviewed.",
